/*
 * Declares the DeferredCtorValue and DeferredMethodValue classes.
 *
 * A DeferredCtorValue is the construction of a template class whose
 * constructor leaves some of the template parameters of the class unresolved,
 * and a DeferredMethodValue a method accessed on it. The template parameters
 * left are solved by the call of the method, the construction being then
 * validated on the inferred specialization.
 *
 * Both values are temporary: they are never emitted into YIL.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::template_::deferred
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/template_/deferred.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-20
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
